# Runway (Native Android) — Environment Template
# Users configure provider API keys directly inside the app's Settings -> Providers screen,
# where keys are encrypted at rest using Google Tink AEAD (AES256-GCM) backed by Android Keystore.
#
# Optional compile-time defaults (if desired via AI Studio Secrets panel):
# DEFAULT_OMNIROUTE_URL=http://192.168.1.100:20128/v1
# GEMINI_API_KEY=MY_GEMINI_API_KEY
